{"name":"The Twin Towers","status":"ok","title":"Twin Towers of the Eternal Eclipse","pageId":41152,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-frwiki pi-layout-default type-building\">\n\n\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Twin Towers of the Eternal Eclipse</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Basic Information</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"type\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Type</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Towers, temple</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"location\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Location</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Small_Teeth\" title=\"Small Teeth\">Small Teeth</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Amn\" title=\"Amn\">Amn</a><sup id=\"cite_ref-LoI-59_1-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-LoI-59-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"owner\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Owner(s)</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Church_of_Cyric\" title=\"Church of Cyric\">Church of Cyric</a>, <small><b>Formerly:</b></small> <a href=\"/wiki/Church_of_Bane\" title=\"Church of Bane\">Church of Bane</a><sup id=\"cite_ref-LoI-59_1-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-LoI-59-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"occupants\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Notable<br>occupants</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Haarken_Akhmelere\" title=\"Haarken Akhmelere\">Haarken Akhmelere</a>,<sup id=\"cite_ref-LoI-59_1-2\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-LoI-59-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup> <a href=\"/wiki/1370_DR\" title=\"1370 DR\">1370 DR</a><sup id=\"cite_ref-LoI-23_2-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-LoI-23-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"worship\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Patron deity</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Cyric\" title=\"Cyric\">Cyric</a>, <small><b>Formerly:</b></small> <a href=\"/wiki/Bane\" title=\"Bane\">Bane</a><sup id=\"cite_ref-LoI-59_1-3\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-LoI-59-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Category:Inhabitants_of_the_Twin_Towers_of_the_Eternal_Eclipse\" class=\"newcategory\" title=\"Category:Inhabitants of the Twin Towers of the Eternal Eclipse\">Inhabitants of the Twin Towers of the Eternal Eclipse</a></nav>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><span class=\"new\" title=\"Category:Organizations in the Twin Towers of the Eternal Eclipse (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvQ2F0ZWdvcnk6T3JnYW5pemF0aW9uc19pbl90aGVfVHdpbl9Ub3dlcnNfb2ZfdGhlX0V0ZXJuYWxfRWNsaXBzZT9hY3Rpb249ZWRpdCZyZWRsaW5rPTE=\">Organizations in the Twin Towers of the Eternal Eclipse</span></nav>\n</aside>\n\nThe <b>Twin Towers of the Eternal Eclipse</b> were a pair of towers hidden high in the <a href=\"/wiki/Small_Teeth\" title=\"Small Teeth\">Small Teeth</a> mountains in the <a href=\"/wiki/Lands_of_Intrigue\" title=\"Lands of Intrigue\">Lands of Intrigue</a>, one on each side of the <a href=\"/wiki/Trade_Way\" title=\"Trade Way\">Trade Way</a>.<sup id=\"cite_ref-LoI-59_1-4\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-LoI-59-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup> Formerly temples to <a href=\"/wiki/Bane\" title=\"Bane\">Bane</a>, they were seized and rededicated as temples to <a href=\"/wiki/Cyric\" title=\"Cyric\">Cyric</a> in the mid-to-late 14<sup>th</sup> century <a href=\"/wiki/DR\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"DR\">DR</a>.<sup id=\"cite_ref-Lod-p12_3-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-Lod-p12-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\"><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Location\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Location</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Structure\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Structure</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Inhabitants\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Inhabitants</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#History\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">History</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Appendix\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Appendix</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#References\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">References</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Location\">Location</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Location\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Twin_Towers_of_the_Eternal_Eclipse?veaction=edit&section=1\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Location\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The towers were about 5 miles (8 kilometers) apart, deep in the highest peaks of the Small Teeth Mountains between <a href=\"/wiki/Amn\" title=\"Amn\">Amn</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Muranndin\" title=\"Muranndin\">Muranndin</a>. The towers were almost completely obscured from view, even from above.<sup id=\"cite_ref-LoI-59_1-5\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-LoI-59-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Structure\">Structure</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Structure\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Twin_Towers_of_the_Eternal_Eclipse?veaction=edit&section=2\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Structure\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Each tower was five stories tall and they were connected by a twisting underground passage.<sup id=\"cite_ref-LoI-59_1-6\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-LoI-59-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Inhabitants\">Inhabitants</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Inhabitants\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Twin_Towers_of_the_Eternal_Eclipse?veaction=edit&section=3\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Inhabitants\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>As of <a href=\"/wiki/1370_DR\" title=\"1370 DR\">1370 DR</a>, Blackwill <a href=\"/wiki/Haarken_Akhmelere\" title=\"Haarken Akhmelere\">Haarken Akhmelere</a> was in charge of the <a href=\"/wiki/Church_of_Cyric\" title=\"Church of Cyric\">church of Cyric</a> congregation.<sup id=\"cite_ref-LoI-23_2-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-LoI-23-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"History\">History</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: History\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Twin_Towers_of_the_Eternal_Eclipse?veaction=edit&section=4\" aria-label=\"Edit section: History\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Originally temples dedicated to <a href=\"/wiki/Bane\" title=\"Bane\">Bane</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Church_of_Cyric\" title=\"Church of Cyric\">Cyricists</a> conquered the towers in the <a href=\"/wiki/1362_DR\" title=\"1362 DR\">Year of the Helm, 1362 DR</a>, and rededicated them to the worship of Cyric.<sup id=\"cite_ref-Lod-p12_3-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-Lod-p12-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p><p>In the <a href=\"/wiki/1373_DR\" title=\"1373 DR\">Year of Rogue Dragons, 1373 DR</a>, the <a href=\"/wiki/Sojourner\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Sojourner\">Sojourner</a> destroyed the western tower to get at the magical <a href=\"/wiki/Granite\" title=\"Granite\">granite</a> it was made out of.<sup id=\"cite_ref-4\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-4\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>4<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup> He moved it to atop the <a href=\"/wiki/Wayrock\" title=\"Wayrock\">Wayrock</a> in the <a href=\"/wiki/Sea_of_Fallen_Stars\" title=\"Sea of Fallen Stars\">Sea of Fallen Stars</a> for his great ritual.<sup id=\"cite_ref-5\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-5\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>5<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup> After his defeat, this tower was later made a temple to <a href=\"/wiki/Mask\" title=\"Mask\">Mask</a> by the <a href=\"/wiki/Assassin\" title=\"Assassin\">assassin</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Priest\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Priest\">priest</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Drasek_Riven\" title=\"Drasek Riven\">Drasek Riven</a>.<sup id=\"cite_ref-6\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-6\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>6<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p><p>During the <a href=\"/wiki/Rage_of_Dragons\" title=\"Rage of Dragons\">Rage of Dragons</a> that same year, <a href=\"/wiki/Iryklathagra\" title=\"Iryklathagra\">Iryklathagra</a> badly damaged the eastern tower<sup id=\"cite_ref-7\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-7\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>7<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup> but on <a href=\"/wiki/Uktar_13\" title=\"Uktar 13\">Uktar 13</a> of the same year, Akhmelere used the <i><span class=\"new\" title=\"Golden Lamp of Samesaj (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvR29sZGVuX0xhbXBfb2ZfU2FtZXNhaj9hY3Rpb249ZWRpdCZyZWRsaW5rPTE=\">Golden Lamp of Samesaj</span></i> to rebuild the western tower and repair the eastern tower.<sup id=\"cite_ref-8\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-8\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>8<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p><p>On <a href=\"/wiki/Flamerule_12\" title=\"Flamerule 12\">Flamerule 12</a> of the <a href=\"/wiki/1374_DR\" title=\"1374 DR\">Year of Lightning Storms, 1374 DR</a>, after a fifty-day siege, the <span class=\"new\" title=\"Army of Three Stars (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvQXJteV9vZl9UaHJlZV9TdGFycz9hY3Rpb249ZWRpdCZyZWRsaW5rPTE=\">Army of Three Stars</span> successfully conquered the western tower, handing it over to Cyricist members of the crusade.<sup id=\"cite_ref-9\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-9\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>9<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Appendix\">Appendix</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Appendix\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Twin_Towers_of_the_Eternal_Eclipse?veaction=edit&section=5\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Appendix\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"metadata plainlinks stub\"><tbody><tr>\n<td><i>This article is incomplete.</i>  <i>You can help the Forgotten Realms Wiki by providing more information.</i></td>\n</tr></tbody></table>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"References\">References</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: References\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Twin_Towers_of_the_Eternal_Eclipse?veaction=edit&section=6\" aria-label=\"Edit section: References\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<div class=\"reflist\">\n<div class=\"mw-references-wrap\"><ol class=\"references\">\n<li id=\"cite_note-LoI-59-1\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\">↑ <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-LoI-59_1-0\">1.0</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-LoI-59_1-1\">1.1</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-LoI-59_1-2\">1.2</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-LoI-59_1-3\">1.3</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-LoI-59_1-4\">1.4</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-LoI-59_1-5\">1.5</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-LoI-59_1-6\">1.6</a></sup></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><a href=\"/wiki/Steven_E._Schend\" title=\"Steven E. Schend\">Steven E. Schend</a>&#160;(August 1997). “Book Two: Amn”. In <a href=\"/wiki/Roger_E._Moore\" title=\"Roger E. Moore\">Roger E. Moore</a>&#160;ed. <i><a href=\"/wiki/Lands_of_Intrigue_(boxed_set)\" title=\"Lands of Intrigue (boxed set)\">Lands of Intrigue</a></i> (<a href=\"/wiki/TSR,_Inc.\" title=\"TSR, Inc.\">TSR, Inc.</a>), p. 59. ISBN&#160;<a href=\"/wiki/Special:BookSources/0-7869-0697-9\" title=\"Special:BookSources/0-7869-0697-9\">0-7869-0697-9</a>.</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite_note-LoI-23-2\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\">↑ <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-LoI-23_2-0\">2.0</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-LoI-23_2-1\">2.1</a></sup></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><a href=\"/wiki/Steven_E._Schend\" title=\"Steven E. Schend\">Steven E. Schend</a>&#160;(August 1997). “Book Two: Amn”. In <a href=\"/wiki/Roger_E._Moore\" title=\"Roger E. Moore\">Roger E. Moore</a>&#160;ed. <i><a href=\"/wiki/Lands_of_Intrigue_(boxed_set)\" title=\"Lands of Intrigue (boxed set)\">Lands of Intrigue</a></i> (<a href=\"/wiki/TSR,_Inc.\" title=\"TSR, Inc.\">TSR, Inc.</a>), p. 23. ISBN&#160;<a href=\"/wiki/Special:BookSources/0-7869-0697-9\" title=\"Special:BookSources/0-7869-0697-9\">0-7869-0697-9</a>.</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite_note-Lod-p12-3\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\">↑ <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-Lod-p12_3-0\">3.0</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-Lod-p12_3-1\">3.1</a></sup></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><a href=\"/wiki/Jason_Ca